1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,303
25,000 chuhe aur ek bhi bimari nahi,

2
00:00:03,303 --> 00:00:05,662
Deshnoke mein kya raaz hai?

3
00:00:05,662 --> 00:00:10,381
Rajasthan ke ek chhote kasbe mein ek anokha mandir hai.

4
00:00:10,381 --> 00:00:14,628
Yahan chuhon ko bhagaaya nahi jaata, khilaaya jaata hai.

5
00:00:14,628 --> 00:00:18,403
Log unhe keede nahi, apne purvaj maante hain.

6
00:00:18,403 --> 00:00:22,650
Aur yahi baat duniya bhar ko hairaan karti hai.

7
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:28,592
Yeh hai Karni Mata ka mandir, Bikaner ke paas, Deshnoke mein.

8
00:00:28,592 --> 00:00:33,995
Safed sangemarmar ka farsh, aur us par daudte kaale chuhe.

9
00:00:33,995 --> 00:00:38,316
Bhakt nange paanv, bahut sambhal kar chalte hain.

10
00:00:38,316 --> 00:00:42,098
Har kadam par neeche dekhna padta hai.

11
00:00:42,098 --> 00:00:47,500
Kyunki yahan farsh ke asli mehmaan insaan nahi, chuhe hain.

12
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:51,501
Lekin asli sawal yeh hai. Itne chuhe, itni bheed,

13
00:00:51,501 --> 00:00:55,502
phir bimari ka dar kyon nahi? Bhakt kehte hain,

14
00:00:55,502 --> 00:00:59,059
yeh Mata ki kripa hai. Doctor kehte hain,

15
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:02,171
chuhe khatarnak keetanu le kar chalte hain.

16
00:01:02,171 --> 00:01:06,616
Aaj hum yeh sab sabut ke saath parkhenge, bina mazaak,

17
00:01:06,616 --> 00:01:07,950
bina faisla sunaaye.

18
00:01:07,950 --> 00:01:13,405
Kahani kai sadiyon pehle ki hai, Rajasthan ke tapte registaan ki.

19
00:01:13,405 --> 00:01:18,859
Wahan ek sant stree thi, jinhe log Karni Mata kehte hain.

20
00:01:18,859 --> 00:01:22,826
Charan samaj, yaani Rajasthan ka ek purana samudaay,

21
00:01:22,826 --> 00:01:28,281
unse gehri aastha rakhta hai. Unke liye yeh sirf kahani nahi,

22
00:01:28,281 --> 00:01:30,760
apne ghar ki yaad hai.

23
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:34,552
Ab socho, ek kachcha aangan, shaam ka waqt.

24
00:01:34,552 --> 00:01:39,766
Ek daadi bachchon ko gher kar baithi hai. Woh kehti hai,

25
00:01:39,766 --> 00:01:44,032
ek baar Mata ke parivaar par bada dukh aaya.

26
00:01:44,032 --> 00:01:49,246
Mata ne haar nahi maani. Woh seedhe Yamraj ke paas gayin,

27
00:01:49,246 --> 00:01:52,090
yaani mrityu ke devta ke paas.

28
00:01:52,090 --> 00:01:55,601
Kahani ke mutabik, wahan ek saudha hua.

29
00:01:55,601 --> 00:02:01,118
Mata ke vansh ke log marne ke baad kahin bhatkenge nahi.

30
00:02:01,118 --> 00:02:05,632
Woh chuhe ban kar Mata ke paas hi rahenge.

31
00:02:05,632 --> 00:02:11,149
Isi mandir mein, isi aangan mein. Daadi muskura kar kehti hai,

32
00:02:11,149 --> 00:02:14,660
isiliye yahan ke chuhe hamare apne hain.

33
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:19,990
In chuhon ko yahan kaba kehte hain. Kaba yaani pavitra chuhe,

34
00:02:19,990 --> 00:02:25,320
jinhe log apne purvaj maante hain. Purvaj yaani hamare baap dada,

35
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:30,651
jo hamse pehle jee chuke. Socho, jise duniya chuha kehti hai,

36
00:02:30,651 --> 00:02:34,043
woh kisi ke pardada ho sakte hain.

37
00:02:34,043 --> 00:02:36,950
Isiliye yahan koi unhe nahi maarta.

38
00:02:36,950 --> 00:02:40,533
Ab ek baat saaf kar dein, imaandari se.

39
00:02:40,533 --> 00:02:43,668
Yeh kahani kisi likhit granth se nahi,

40
00:02:43,668 --> 00:02:47,699
local parampara se aati hai. Yeh peedhi dar peedhi,

41
00:02:47,699 --> 00:02:52,626
zubaani chalti aayi hai. Isliye is panel par label hai legend.

42
00:02:52,626 --> 00:02:54,417
Iska matlab jhooth nahi,

43
00:02:54,417 --> 00:02:58,000
bas itna ki likhit sabut hamare paas nahi.

44
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:01,306
Ab kahani se nikal kar patthar par aate hain.

45
00:03:01,306 --> 00:03:05,347
Jo mandir aaj aap dekhte ho, woh bahut purana nahi hai.

46
00:03:05,347 --> 00:03:06,816
Rajasthan Tourism ke mutabik,

47
00:03:06,816 --> 00:03:10,122
iska nirmaan pichhli sadi ki shuruaat mein poora hua.

48
00:03:10,122 --> 00:03:14,530
Yeh kaam Bikaner ke Maharaja Ganga Singh ki dekh rekh mein hua.

49
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:19,751
Poora mandir sangemarmar se bana hai, upar se neeche tak.

50
00:03:19,751 --> 00:03:22,883
Iski banawat mein Rajput shaili hai,

51
00:03:22,883 --> 00:03:28,627
aur Mughal shaili ki jhalak bhi. Shaili yaani banane ka andaaz,

52
00:03:28,627 --> 00:03:33,847
jaise mehraab, jaali aur nakkashi. Alag alag zamaane ka hunar,

53
00:03:33,847 --> 00:03:36,980
ek hi deewar par dikhta hai.

54
00:03:36,980 --> 00:03:41,829
Mandir mein ghuste hi aankh darwaazon par atak jaati hai.

55
00:03:41,829 --> 00:03:44,738
Yeh thos chaandi ke darwaaze hain.

56
00:03:44,738 --> 00:03:48,132
Inke panel par ubhri hui nakkashi hai.

57
00:03:48,132 --> 00:03:53,466
Ubhri nakkashi yaani aisi tasveer, jo sateh se bahar uthi ho.

58
00:03:53,466 --> 00:03:57,830
In tasveeron mein Karni Mata ki kahaniyan khudi hain.

59
00:03:57,830 --> 00:04:01,272
Yaani jo kahani daadi zubaani sunaati hai,

60
00:04:01,272 --> 00:04:06,190
wahi chaandi par bhi likhi hai. Bas shabdon mein nahi,

61
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,174
tasveeron mein.

62
00:04:07,174 --> 00:04:12,092
Kai bhakt darwaaze ke saamne ruk kar sir jhukaate hain.

63
00:04:12,092 --> 00:04:16,026
Kuch log har panel dhyaan se dekhte hain,

64
00:04:16,026 --> 00:04:19,960
jaise kisi kitaab ke panne palat rahe hon.

65
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:25,304
Andar garbhgriha hai, yaani mandir ka sabse andar wala pavitra kamra.

66
00:04:25,304 --> 00:04:29,190
Wahan Karni Mata ki patthar ki murti hai.

67
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:34,049
Rajasthan Tourism ke anusaar iski oonchai lagbhag 0.75 metre hai.

68
00:04:34,049 --> 00:04:39,393
Matlab ek chhote bachche jitni. Murti ke haath mein trishul hai,

69
00:04:39,393 --> 00:04:40,850
sir par mukut.

70
00:04:40,850 --> 00:04:45,280
Murti ke aas paas unki behnon ki pratimaayein bhi hain.

71
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:50,153
Mukut aur maalaon se saji murti, aur saamne bhakton ki qatar.

72
00:04:50,153 --> 00:04:54,584
Aur yahin, garbhgriha ke paas, chuhe bhi jama rehte hain.

73
00:04:54,584 --> 00:04:59,900
Aisa lagta hai jaise woh bhi darshan ki line mein khade hon.

74
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:04,075
Ab upar dekhiye. Aangan ke upar jaali lagi hai,

75
00:05:04,075 --> 00:05:05,466
hifaazat ke liye.

76
00:05:05,466 --> 00:05:11,033
Yeh jaali chuhon ko upar se aane wale khatre se bachaati hai,

77
00:05:11,033 --> 00:05:16,135
jaise shikari parinde. Matlab mandir sirf chuhon ko sehta nahi hai.

78
00:05:16,135 --> 00:05:20,310
Woh unki hifaazat ka poora intezaam bhi karta hai.

79
00:05:20,310 --> 00:05:24,047
Ab mandir ke sabse bade raaz ki baat.

80
00:05:24,047 --> 00:05:26,383
Hazaron kaale chuhon ke beech,

81
00:05:26,383 --> 00:05:31,522
kabhi kabhi ek safed chuha dikhta hai. Aur jab dikhta hai,

82
00:05:31,522 --> 00:05:36,661
to aangan mein halchal mach jaati hai. Log ishaara karte hain,

83
00:05:36,661 --> 00:05:41,800
phusphusaate hain. Sabki nazar ek hi kone par tik jaati hai.

84
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,227
Kyon?

85
00:05:42,227 --> 00:05:46,919
Kyunki safed chuhon ko khaas taur par pavitra maana jaata hai.

86
00:05:46,919 --> 00:05:48,626
Rajasthan Tourism likhta hai,

87
00:05:48,626 --> 00:05:53,318
log inhe Karni Mata aur unke beton ka avatar maante hain.

88
00:05:53,318 --> 00:05:58,011
Avatar yaani kisi devi devta ka dharti par liya hua roop.

89
00:05:58,011 --> 00:06:01,850
Isliye safed chuha dikhna bada saubhagya maana jaata hai.

90
00:06:01,850 --> 00:06:06,708
Bhakt unhe bahar bulaane ke liye badi mehnat karte hain.

91
00:06:06,708 --> 00:06:10,595
Mithai rakhte hain, ghanton chupchaap intezaar karte hain.

92
00:06:10,595 --> 00:06:16,424
Ek maa apne bete ka haath pakad kar kone mein jhaankti hai.

93
00:06:16,424 --> 00:06:18,853
Bas ek jhalak mil jaaye.

94
00:06:18,853 --> 00:06:22,740
Unke liye yeh seedha Mata ka aashirvaad hai.

95
00:06:22,740 --> 00:06:28,442
Ab andaza lagaiye, yahan kitne chuhe hain? Ek anumaan ke mutabik,

96
00:06:28,442 --> 00:06:34,145
lagbhag 25,000 kaale chuhe. Inmein safed chuhe gine chune hi hain.

97
00:06:34,145 --> 00:06:36,219
To safed chuha dhoondhna,

98
00:06:36,219 --> 00:06:40,366
bheed mein ek khaas chehra dhoondhne jaisa hai.

99
00:06:40,366 --> 00:06:45,550
Yahi rare hona use aur bhi pavitra bana deta hai.

100
00:06:45,550 --> 00:06:48,208
Ek baat science ki bhi.

101
00:06:48,208 --> 00:06:51,930
Yahan ke kaale chuhe Rattus rattus hain.

102
00:06:51,930 --> 00:06:54,588
Yaani wahi aam kaala chuha,

103
00:06:54,588 --> 00:06:58,310
jo ghar aur godaam mein milta hai.

104
00:06:58,310 --> 00:07:03,627
Koi anokhi jaati nahi hai. Fark bas nazariye ka hai.

105
00:07:03,627 --> 00:07:07,880
Baahar inhe dushman maana jaata hai, yahan parivaar.

106
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,321
Ab woh sawal,

107
00:07:09,321 --> 00:07:13,643
jiske liye shayad aap yeh video dekh rahe ho.

108
00:07:13,643 --> 00:07:17,004
Kya yahan sach mein bimari nahi phailti?

109
00:07:17,004 --> 00:07:21,326
Bhakton ka daava bahut bada hai. Unka kehna hai,

110
00:07:21,326 --> 00:07:26,128
yeh jagah plague se achhooti rahi. Plague yaani woh mahamaari,

111
00:07:26,128 --> 00:07:29,490
jo chuhon ke pissuon se phailti hai.

112
00:07:29,490 --> 00:07:32,292
Isse bhi chaunkane wala daava sun lijiye.

113
00:07:32,292 --> 00:07:35,093
Jis prasad ko chuhon ne chakh liya,

114
00:07:35,093 --> 00:07:38,695
use bahut pavitra maana jaata hai. Bhakt kehte hain,

115
00:07:38,695 --> 00:07:41,497
use khaane se koi nuksaan nahi hota.

116
00:07:41,497 --> 00:07:45,098
Yeh daava bahut logon ki aastha se juda hai.

117
00:07:45,098 --> 00:07:47,900
Hum ise halke mein nahi le rahe.

118
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:52,467
Ab doosri taraf ki baat suniye. Medical researchers kehte hain,

119
00:07:52,467 --> 00:07:55,665
chuhe khatarnak pathogens le kar chalte hain.

120
00:07:55,665 --> 00:07:59,775
Pathogens yaani woh chhote keetanu, jo bimari failaate hain.

121
00:07:59,775 --> 00:08:04,343
Yeh baat duniya bhar ke chuhon par laagu hoti hai.

122
00:08:04,343 --> 00:08:08,910
Deshnoke ke chuhe bhi biology mein wahi Rattus rattus hain.

123
00:08:08,910 --> 00:08:11,835
To sach kya hai? Seedhi baat suniye.

124
00:08:11,835 --> 00:08:15,597
Is daave par koi verified study maujood nahi hai.

125
00:08:15,597 --> 00:08:19,776
Na yeh sabit hua ki yahan bimari bilkul nahi hoti.

126
00:08:19,776 --> 00:08:23,955
Na yeh sabit hua ki yahan bimari zyada failti hai.

127
00:08:23,955 --> 00:08:26,880
Daave hain, par napa hua data nahi.

128
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:30,735
Yahan ek fark samajhna zaroori hai. Bimari nahi hoti,

129
00:08:30,735 --> 00:08:35,018
aur bimari ka record nahi hai, yeh alag baatein hain.

130
00:08:35,018 --> 00:08:40,157
Kabhi kabhi hum record ki kami ko hi sabut maan lete hain.

131
00:08:40,157 --> 00:08:43,155
Lekin khaali register kuch sabit nahi karta.

132
00:08:43,155 --> 00:08:47,010
Woh bas batata hai ki kisi ne gina nahi.

133
00:08:47,010 --> 00:08:51,838
Researchers ek khaas cheez ki kami batate hain. Epidemiological study,

134
00:08:51,838 --> 00:08:56,184
yaani bade paimane par logon ki sehat ka hisaab.

135
00:08:56,184 --> 00:09:01,012
Kitne log aaye, kitne beemar pade, aur kis wajah se.

136
00:09:01,012 --> 00:09:05,357
Aisa systematic adhyayan is mandir par hua hi nahi.

137
00:09:05,357 --> 00:09:09,220
Isliye vigyan abhi koi faisla nahi suna sakta.

138
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:11,907
Isliye is panel par label hai disputed.

139
00:09:11,907 --> 00:09:15,362
Matlab bhakt aur experts alag alag baat kehte hain.

140
00:09:15,362 --> 00:09:17,665
Bhakt aastha ki baat karte hain.

141
00:09:17,665 --> 00:09:19,968
Doctor saavdhani ki baat karte hain.

142
00:09:19,968 --> 00:09:22,655
Aur beech mein woh khaali jagah hai,

143
00:09:22,655 --> 00:09:26,110
jahan sabut hona chahiye tha, par abhi nahi hai.

144
00:09:26,110 --> 00:09:27,819
Agar aap jaate ho,

145
00:09:27,819 --> 00:09:31,236
to doctor wali saavdhani bhi saath le jaiye.

146
00:09:31,236 --> 00:09:35,081
Haath achhe se dhoiye, chot ho to dhyaan rakhiye,

147
00:09:35,081 --> 00:09:39,352
bachchon par nazar rakhiye. Yeh aastha ke khilaaf nahi hai.

148
00:09:39,352 --> 00:09:44,051
Yeh bas apni sehat ki zimmedari hai. Mata ka darshan bhi,

149
00:09:44,051 --> 00:09:45,760
aur apna khayal bhi.

150
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:49,820
Ab woh baatein, jo aaj bhi koi nahi jaanta. Sabse pehle,

151
00:09:49,820 --> 00:09:53,511
yeh chuhe kitni tezi se marte hain? Unki mrityu dar,

152
00:09:53,511 --> 00:09:56,095
yaani kitne chuhe har saal marte hain,

153
00:09:56,095 --> 00:09:58,310
kabhi theek se napi nahi gayi.

154
00:09:58,310 --> 00:10:02,370
Itni badi colony ka yeh hisaab kisi ke paas nahi hai.

155
00:10:02,370 --> 00:10:07,786
Phir sawal parjeeviyon ka. Parjeevi yaani parasites, jaise pissu aur keede,

156
00:10:07,786 --> 00:10:10,740
jo doosre jeev par palte hain.

157
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:15,170
Yahi cheez bimari ka khatra badha bhi sakti hai,

158
00:10:15,170 --> 00:10:20,586
ghata bhi sakti hai. Par in chuhon par kitne parjeevi hain,

159
00:10:20,586 --> 00:10:23,540
iska koi napa hua record nahi.

160
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:26,580
Aur sabse dilchasp sawal yeh hai.

161
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:30,632
Chuhe mandir chhod kar bahar kyon nahi jaate?

162
00:10:30,632 --> 00:10:34,685
Aas paas registaani kasba hai, khula aur bada.

163
00:10:34,685 --> 00:10:39,244
Phir bhi colony zyadatar mandir mein hi rehti hai.

164
00:10:39,244 --> 00:10:42,790
Bhakt ise Mata ka bandhan kehte hain.

165
00:10:42,790 --> 00:10:45,830
Vigyan ke paas sirf andaze hain.

166
00:10:45,830 --> 00:10:49,357
Ek andaza hai, roz ka bharpoor khaana.

167
00:10:49,357 --> 00:10:53,388
Mithai aur prasad sab yahin mil jaata hai,

168
00:10:53,388 --> 00:10:58,427
to bahar kyon jaana? Ek aur andaza hai social habituation.

169
00:10:58,427 --> 00:11:03,969
Yaani jaanwar ek jagah aur insaanon ke aadi ho jaate hain.

170
00:11:03,969 --> 00:11:08,000
Par yeh sab andaze hain, abhi sabit nahi.

171
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:14,131
To dekhiye, kahani ke paas jawab hai, vigyan ke paas sawal.

172
00:11:14,131 --> 00:11:20,262
Aur yahi is jagah ko itna khaas banata hai. Ek mandir,

173
00:11:20,262 --> 00:11:24,721
jahan aastha aur science aamne saamne khade hain.

174
00:11:24,721 --> 00:11:28,066
Aur beech mein hazaron chuhe, bekhabar,

175
00:11:28,066 --> 00:11:31,410
aaraam se prasad kha rahe hain.

176
00:11:31,410 --> 00:11:34,067
Agar aap Deshnoke jaana chahte ho,

177
00:11:34,067 --> 00:11:36,724
to yeh Bikaner ke paas hai.

178
00:11:36,724 --> 00:11:41,595
Rajasthan Tourism ki website par is mandir ki jaankari maujood hai.

179
00:11:41,595 --> 00:11:44,695
Pahunch kar pehle chaandi ke darwaaze dekhiye.

180
00:11:44,695 --> 00:11:48,237
Har panel ek kahani hai. Ruk kar dekhoge,

181
00:11:48,237 --> 00:11:51,780
to poori katha tasveeron mein samajh aa jaayegi.

182
00:11:51,780 --> 00:11:56,874
Andar sangemarmar ka aangan hai, upar hifaazat ki jaali.

183
00:11:56,874 --> 00:12:02,533
Garbhgriha mein lagbhag 0.75 metre oonchi murti, trishul ke saath.

184
00:12:02,533 --> 00:12:08,759
Aur farsh par har taraf kaba. Nange paanv chalna hota hai,

185
00:12:08,759 --> 00:12:14,418
to dheere chaliye. Kisi ko chot na pahunche, na aapko,

186
00:12:14,418 --> 00:12:15,550
na unhe.

187
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:19,897
Yaad rakhiye, yeh museum nahi, jeeta jaagta mandir hai.

188
00:12:19,897 --> 00:12:24,727
Yahan log pooja karne aate hain, mannat maangne aate hain.

189
00:12:24,727 --> 00:12:29,558
Photo lijiye, par kisi ki aastha ka mazaak mat banaiye.

190
00:12:29,558 --> 00:12:34,388
Jo dekhne aaye ho, use dil se dekhiye. Sawal poochiye,

191
00:12:34,388 --> 00:12:36,320
par izzat ke saath.

192
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:39,050
Aur haan, nazar safed chuhe par rakhiye.

193
00:12:39,050 --> 00:12:43,340
Shayad ghanton baad bhi na dikhe. Shayad aate hi dikh jaaye.

194
00:12:43,340 --> 00:12:47,240
Wahan khade logon ki aankhon mein jo ummeed hoti hai,

195
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:49,970
woh apne aap mein ek nazara hai.

196
00:12:49,970 --> 00:12:53,090
Woh pal kisi photo mein poora nahi samaata.

197
00:12:53,090 --> 00:12:56,550
To aaj ki baat ka nichod kya hai?

198
00:12:56,550 --> 00:13:01,309
Mandir ka sangemarmar aur chaandi, Rajasthan Tourism ke record mein hai.

199
00:13:01,309 --> 00:13:05,634
Kaba ki kahani, local parampara mein hai. Bimari wala daava,

200
00:13:05,634 --> 00:13:10,392
abhi bina kisi study ke hai. Yeh sab alag cheezein hain,

201
00:13:10,392 --> 00:13:13,420
aur inhe alag nazar se dekhna chahiye.

202
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:18,198
Agle safar mein hum samundar ki taraf chalenge. Ek aisi nagri,

203
00:13:18,198 --> 00:13:23,411
jiske baare mein kaha jaata hai ki woh paani mein sama gayi.

204
00:13:23,411 --> 00:13:26,886
Naam hai Dwarka. Wahan kya mila, kisne dhoondha,

205
00:13:26,886 --> 00:13:30,795
kya abhi bhi sawal hai, sab sabut ke saath.

206
00:13:30,795 --> 00:13:34,270
Tab tak Deshnoke ki yeh kahani yaad rakhiye.

207
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:37,726
Ab aapse ek aasaan sa sawal.

208
00:13:37,726 --> 00:13:42,909
Agar Deshnoke mein aapke saamne safed chuha aa jaaye,

209
00:13:42,909 --> 00:13:46,365
to aap kya karoge? Photo loge,

210
00:13:46,365 --> 00:13:52,700
ya haath jod kar chupchaap ruk jaoge? Comments mein zaroor bataiye.
